5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited for this! I want to make sure the money side of things is totally clear, so I'll check the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want everyone to feel welcome and connected this year. I'll look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I want to ensure the workload is manageable for the organizers. I'll check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, and the group transport in three years of receipts.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know if we'll actually get any sleep! I'll check the vacation timetable for the club's own hall and the accounts from two clubs that went inland.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll look into the lottery and application for public group bookings, and the membership list against first-train times.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
